WEBVTT

00:11:58.776 --> 00:12:02.746
But before all, they are meant
to be thought-provoking.

00:12:02.770 --> 00:12:04.034
You feel hurt?

00:12:04.058 --> 00:12:05.526
Just let it go.

00:12:05.550 --> 00:12:07.360
You don't like it?

00:12:07.384 --> 00:12:08.743
Look the other way.

00:12:10.459 --> 00:12:14.332
Freedom of expression
is not incompatible with dialogue

00:12:14.356 --> 00:12:15.931
and listening to each other.

00:12:15.955 --> 00:12:19.367
But it is incompatible with intolerance.

00:12:19.911 --> 00:12:24.942
(Applause)

00:12:25.897 --> 00:12:32.679
Let us not become our own censors
in the name of political correctness.